  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "329期封面作品-《台文通訊》 海內外交流座談會"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">《台文通訊》</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">海內外交流座談會</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">相片簡介</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2004年，李江却台語文教基金會舉辦《台文通訊》海內外交流座談會，參與者包含bat擔任《台文通訊》海外編輯人員ê李勤岸、葉國基、張秀滿、李淵雅，作家陳雷翁仔某、蕭平治、洪錦田、清文，擔任《台文BONG報》雜誌社務委員ê邱文錫、呂子銘、吳玉祥、鄭吉棠、月琴唸歌薪傳師洪瑞珍、日本學者酒井亨、刁工tuì瑞典tńg來參加ê作者黃晴美kap李江却台語文教基金會讀冊會成員。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgSuGOwNYQu8kr7rmRyFGJ4a094gUYuA14P3wa32N92JIYTl9EXoWCCoG-UFFf5nctebBuOQI4b_TzqAu89DCqhGFi6irIKFGApAsUsd5fcQNnPnXB7dyweOnTirVYh2hQIUetyds0ZyMyX/s1429/329%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1429\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgSuGOwNYQu8kr7rmRyFGJ4a094gUYuA14P3wa32N92JIYTl9EXoWCCoG-UFFf5nctebBuOQI4b_TzqAu89DCqhGFi6irIKFGApAsUsd5fcQNnPnXB7dyweOnTirVYh2hQIUetyds0ZyMyX/w448-h640/329%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left;\">台文通訊BONG報329期，2021年8月出刊。</b></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit;\"></span></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span>&nbsp;</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div>"
  },
